# Gimmy Cards — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill with your Supabase project values
# (Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API).
#
# Leave BOTH empty to run the isolated DEMO mode (in-browser database,
# sample data clearly marked as DEMO, nothing sent anywhere).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NEVER put the service_role key in any VITE_* variable: everything prefixed
# with VITE_ is shipped to the browser.
